# WP11/G40: triggers.cfg (written by Remix's own #trigger save, CRLF) is loaded at startup
# (FormMain.cs:2339 R), so the {charging} trigger fires with no loader script run.
# The third line arrives after the trigger's own `#class charging off`; the script's
# `#trigger load` reads Config.ConfigDir\triggers.cfg, which does not exist here, so the
# registry is left as it was (Load returns false and does not clear, Command.cs:1380-1384 R).
